# A deck with two pages and a pad that asks first, pushed to the preview.
wait-for Todo
companion deck push --sim --home apps/deck/fixtures/two-pages
# The preview reads the pushed pads when Deck opens again.
restart
wait-for Test
expect Deploy
expect Build
expect-missing Todo
clean
shot pages-build
# Each page has a tab, and the bar names the page showing.
tap Home
wait-for Lights
expect-missing Deploy
clean
shot pages-home
tap Build
wait-for Deploy
# A pad tapped in the preview says it is a preview instead of running.
tap Test
wait-for Preview only. Pair with your computer to use these pads.
# Said once: the line under the tabs steps aside while the banner says it.
expect-missing Pair to run commands.
clean
shot pages-preview-press
# A pad that asks first must not ask to run on a computer that is not paired.
tap Deploy
wait-idle
expect-missing Run this on the paired computer?
expect Preview only. Pair with your computer to use these pads.
